# =============================================================================
# Airport Energy - environment variables
# =============================================================================
# The backend is Firebase (Auth + Firestore). Firebase web config is PUBLIC
# by design and lives directly in src/lib/firebase.js - there are no build
# secrets to set for it. Security is enforced by Firestore rules
# (firestore.rules) and Firebase Auth, not by hiding the config.
#
# This file is kept for any future env vars the project might need.
# =============================================================================
